{"c":[{"id":"4545e77a54ec6e77","sum":"Local tox: run-parallel, session fixture, no --basetemp; env pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage serial. PR CI is pr.yaml py311–py314; main is ci.yaml plus coverage. #65/#66 closed #63/#64.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"45cf7d8ae1c3a941","sum":"local tox: run-parallel, session fixture, no --basetemp; CI matrix on PR, coverage only on main","tree":{"c":[{"id":"36328cf904c2428a","sum":"local tox: run-parallel, session fixture, no --basetemp; nap-variant-stems archived","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T010300Z-417024a4752a8337","text":"nap-variant-stems archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260825-nap-variant-stems.md; draft PR #62; PR review all dismissed","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T012700Z-be1b409a2bdf91a3","text":"Full local tox is tox run-parallel; pytest --basetemp is TMPDIR/summem-{env} so outside-repo tests stay outside the clone; tests load summem via a session fixture.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e9d850f97d191356","sum":"tox: run-parallel locally, no --basetemp, session fixture; CI matrix on PR, coverage only on main","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T014547Z-7e85524296498ed1","text":"Full local tox is tox run-parallel; do not pass pytest --basetemp (default already isolates outside the clone). Tests cache summem in conftest._SUMMEM because migrate.py and surgery.py overwrite sys.modules['summem'].","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T020511Z-dedaa99398372c27","text":"CI runs tox py311-py314 on pull requests and on main; tox -e coverage and the Codecov upload run only on pushes to main.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ac119d66989496d0","sum":"Local tox: run-parallel; each env pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage serial. PR CI is pr.yaml (py311–py314); main is ci.yaml plus coverage. #65 closed #63; #66 closed #64.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d3a518852906da6f","sum":"Local tox: run-parallel, session fixture. PR CI is .github/workflows/pr.yaml (py311–py314); main is ci.yaml plus coverage. tox-speedup archived; PR #65 closed #63.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T020911Z-dc61c4600974926c","text":"PR checks are .github/workflows/pr.yaml (tox py311-py314). Main CI is .github/workflows/ci.yaml (same matrix plus coverage upload).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T021234Z-bd17f467296b95fc","text":"tox-speedup archived: local tox run-parallel, session summem fixture, PR/ci workflow split. Draft PR #65 closes #63.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ef12b6001b08fed","sum":"Each tox env is pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage stays serial; 0 serial markers; PR #66 closes #64.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T024233Z-b9bc41aef5017da0","text":"Each tox env runs pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage stays serial. Serial markers: 0. Unbounded auto made tox run-parallel slower.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T030409Z-e8788d730d1e85ab","text":"pytest-xdist archived: each tox env is -n auto --maxprocesses=4; 0 serial markers; PR #66 closes #64.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"143544e6ec1e6aa3","sum":"16-hex leafset (SHA-256[:16]); migrate.py only 4/5-part-64 reader; first birthday is a widen PR; atlas Identity is the line; nap-ack: Saved. then fold or idle","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f8e4c51c47553dd2","sum":"16-hex (#67): SHA-256[:16] in leafset_id, stems, nested NapChild.id; migrate.py is the only 4-part and 5-part-64 reader; first birthday is a widen PR. README walkthrough still shows a 64-hex pair name; atlas Identity is the real line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a6d10958ef7a6ee6","sum":"16-hex leafset (#67): store ids are SHA-256[:16]; migrate.py rewrites 4-part and 5-part-64 (nested ids, new variant); first birthday is a widen PR, do not pre-empt.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T030848Z-6dd27b032a8f016d","text":"Issue #67: stored leaf-set ids become 16 hex; migrate.py consumes 4-part and 5-part-64 stems, writes 5-part-16 only (rewrite nested .tree ids, recompute variant).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T031521Z-7a97f5ab2c7bcdc0","text":"16-hex leafset (#67): whoever first hits the birthday sends a PR that widens the field and adds a new migrate.py; do not pre-empt.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4f3e636fac243401","sum":"16-hex (#67): one width in leafset_id for view ids, stems, nested NapChild.id; migrate.py is the only 4-part and 5-part-64 reader. README walkthrough still shows a 64-hex pair name; atlas Identity is the real line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T032419Z-eb9e2bbccde1ebf1","text":"16-hex leafset (#67): truncate inside leafset_id so note view ids, nap stems, and nested NapChild.id share one width; migrate.py is the only 4-part and 5-part-64 reader.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T033238Z-2920440793dd567a","text":"Preflight #67: README on-disk walkthrough still shows a 64-hex leaf-set in the pair basename; there is no in-tree #61 do-not-shorten sentence — atlas Identity 'Stored names keep the full id' is the real line.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"851029656cfd973f","sum":"16-hex-leafset archived; nap-ack prints Saved. then fold or idle","tree":{"c":[{"id":"60d6151770f06a24","sum":"16-hex-leafset built then archived; PR #68 review-clean, ready to merge and close #67","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T042031Z-6b03a81f7ebe2424","text":"16-hex-leafset built: leafset_id is SHA-256[:16]; migrate.py rewrites 4-part-64 and 5-part-64 (nested ids, new variant); root and dogfood stores migrated.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T131401Z-803adc196488671b","text":"16-hex-leafset archived; PR #68 review-clean (incl. CodeRabbit), ready to merge and close #67","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"96eb80a6d5d89d9a","sum":"nap-ack: Saved. then fold or idle; ratchet stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260828T153444Z-2d2f206f379e45f2","text":"nap-ack L2: successful nap prints Saved. then fold or Nothing left to compress; ENTRY_CHARS ratchet still silent","type":"note"},{"name":"20260828T155248Z-8215d9d28b8c6de4","text":"nap-ack: successful nap prints Saved. then fold or Nothing left to compress; ratchet stays silent; idle is nap-only","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
